'''Deathshard''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through [[trading]].

==Appearance==
Deathshard, unlike other knives, has a silver split blade, meaning that its blade has been divided into two. Its guard with curved quillons appears to use Roblox’s [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Black_Iron_(series) Black Iron] texture. The handle is black in color with a tape-like grip on it.

==Trivia==
*This and [[Chroma Deathshard]] are the smallest [[Godly Weapons|godlies]] in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Deathshard]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/62350856/Ghostfire-Dagger Ghostfire Dagger]. However, the shadow aura was removed and the guard is darker in color.
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 25 godly [[shards]].
*This and [[Chroma Deathshard]] have an similar throw animation as [[Fang]], [[Chroma Fang]] and [[Winter's Edge]].
*Deathshard's original icon used to face straight up before the [[Season 1|Season 1]] update.

